  "quality_assurance": {
    "annotation_quality": "Manually annotated wide-view images reported in source publication. The source class file lists 13 names; 'Sealed Block Crack' (2 boxes) and 'Sealed Transverse Crack' (1 box) are very rare, and 'PCC' and 'PCC longitudinal' have no boxes in the released annotations. Class names are shown with corrected spelling (Transverse, Alligator); the raw annotation files keep the source spelling. One image (MN 73-89-500 (13).jpg) is 124x383 pixels while its annotation declares 640x640 (15 boxes), so its boxes are normalized by the declared size.",
